Converted from cn_dicts/8105.dict.yaml and cn_dicts/base.dict.yaml.
The reproducible converter is tools/build_pinyin_dictionary.py in the app source.
dictionary.json records the checksums, retained entry count and format exclusions.

Rime Ice attributes the 8105 character readings to the Wiktionary Common
Standard Chinese Characters pinyin index and the character frequencies to
the BLCU 2.5-billion-character corpus frequency table:
https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/Appendix:汉语拼音索引/通用规范汉字表
https://faculty.blcu.edu.cn/xinghb/zh_CN/article/167473/content/1437.htm

